            "resp_left_incompat_left",
            "resp_right_compat_right",
            "resp_right_incompat_right"
        ]
    },
    "notes": "Same flanker task recordings as ERN, analyzed for lateralized readiness potential. LRP = difference between contralateral and ipsilateral motor cortex (C3, C4). For classification: left-hand correct response vs right-hand correct response. LRP expected at C3/C4, stimulus-locked, reflecting motor preparation lateralization.",
